    description: "C analyzer (c.py lines 421-541) detects function-pointer dispatch tables in static array initializers, emitting dispatches_to and uses_dispatch_table edges. C++ has no equivalent despite using identical patterns (command dispatch, plugin registries, state machines). Fix: port C's dispatch table detection logic to cpp.py, adapting for C++ AST node types. Discovered via falco bakeoff — load_rules_files has zero incoming calls edges because the action dispatch loop is not captured."  # ceee
